  "title": "Unified 3D Generation and Scene Control Frameworks",
  "summary": "Code4Scene evaluates coding agents' ability to construct and edit 3D scenes, while LEGO-Anything introduces a coding framework for 3D scene reconstruction. These benchmarks highlight gaps in spatial reasoning and state control between plausible 3D generation and reliable scene control.",
